0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 552.64 Tm (Generative artificial intelligence \(AI\) can extend a person's practical capacity to undertake research) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 537.84 Tm (beyond the methods that person can independently execute or evaluate. This retrospective,) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 523.04 Tm (single-investigator case study examines a human-directed inquiry that moved from computer) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 508.24 Tm (architecture to computational regulatory genomics, then to the investigation of its own methods. The) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 493.44 Tm (evidence comprises selected dated manuscript versions, public repository records, reported) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 478.64 Tm (computational audits and investigator testimony. The revised record includes a negative genomic pilot,) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 463.84 Tm (equivalence testing, a cross-platform critique and revision process, an exploratory binding-profile) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 449.04 Tm (analysis, a statistical correction, and feedback from the empirical work into the theoretical framework.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 434.24 Tm (We distinguish methodological reach, epistemic competence and evidential warrant, and propose that) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 419.44 Tm (recognition of a gap between them should trigger an observable process of learning, independent) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 404.64 Tm (reproduction and specialist consultation. A multi-AI workflow can produce reviewable artifacts and) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 389.84 Tm (alternative analyses; agreement between models does not establish scientific truth or replace) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 375.04 Tm (accountable human review. The case demonstrates a feasible research process and records its) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 360.24 Tm (unresolved verification burden, not a discovery claim or a causal productivity advantage. We outline a) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 345.44 Tm (practical framework and a prospective evaluation design for STEM education and metascience.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 322.64 Tm (Keywords: artificial intelligence; metacognition; scientific agency; interdisciplinary inquiry; epistemic) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 307.84 Tm (responsibility; reproducibility; STEM education.) Tj ET
0.090 0.412 0.373 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 285.04 Tm (1. Introduction) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 255.30 Tm (An investigator may understand a question before possessing the expertise required to answer it. AI) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 240.50 Tm (can assist in translating that question into a model, locating evidence, implementing a computation and) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 225.70 Tm (drafting a report. These operations can become accessible before their assumptions become) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 210.90 Tm (intelligible. The resulting problem is not simply how to produce more science, but how to develop) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 196.10 Tm (understanding and warranted judgment alongside the ability to produce research artifacts.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 173.30 Tm (This paper asks what happens when an investigator notices that gap and responds to it. Its subject is) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 158.50 Tm (the process of inquiry, not the biological truth of the companion research. The case is useful even if the) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 143.70 Tm (biological conclusions are subsequently revised or rejected.) Tj ET
