0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 693.26 Tm (Metacognition concerns monitoring and regulation of one's cognitive processes [1]. In AI-assisted) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 678.46 Tm (scientific work, monitoring must also extend to the origin, quality and limits of reasoning supplied by a) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 663.66 Tm (tool. Messeri and Crockett [2] identify the danger that greater production can coexist with reduced) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 648.86 Tm (understanding. The case examined here adds an observable response to that danger: the investigator) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 634.06 Tm (recognizes uncertainty and asks what to do about it.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 611.26 Tm (Methodological reach means the research operations that an investigator can initiate and complete with) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 596.46 Tm (available tools and assistance. Epistemic competence means the capacity to explain the purpose,) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 581.66 Tm (assumptions, limitations and meaning of those operations, personally or with identifiable qualified) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 566.86 Tm (support. Evidential warrant means how well a specific claim is supported by valid, independently) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 552.06 Tm (assessable evidence. The three are distinct: a computation can be executable, difficult to explain, and) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 537.26 Tm (inadequately validated at the same time. Conversely, one may understand a method without) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 522.46 Tm (possessing sufficient data to use it conclusively.) Tj ET
