0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 693.26 Tm (Inquiry-based science education emphasizes meaningful questions, observation, explanation and) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 678.46 Tm (communication [12]. For the augmented investigator, a useful educational principle is experience before) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 663.66 Tm (equation: start with a phenomenon worth understanding, then use the need for explanation to motivate) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 648.86 Tm (acquisition of the necessary methods. This differs from using AI to bypass the experience.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 626.06 Tm (Consider a classroom investigation in which students measure the cooling of a cup of water. AI may) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 611.26 Tm (help them build a graph, fit a model or identify a suspicious measurement. The learner must still explain) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 596.46 Tm (what was measured, how the thermometer was used, why the model has a particular form, what a) Tj ET
