0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 566.86 Tm (a hypothesis to confront with data.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 544.06 Tm (The advanced analogue is the enhancer-equivalence case. A learner should be able to explain why) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 529.26 Tm ("not significantly different" does not mean equivalent, why margin choice matters and why replicates) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 514.46 Tm (must be independent. An expert can review the statistical implementation. Learning is not measured) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 499.66 Tm (simply by generating the final report.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 476.86 Tm (Proposed assessment rubric. Rate each dimension on a transparent 0-2 scale: 0 = missing or) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 462.06 Tm (unexplained; 1 = partial with prompting or identifiable help; 2 = clear, evidence-linked explanation or) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 447.26 Tm (demonstrated action. The six dimensions are question quality, method explanation, evidence) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 432.46 Tm (interpretation, recognition of limits, independent checking and claim calibration. Use multiple human) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 417.66 Tm (raters and assess inter-rater agreement before treating scores as reliable.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 394.86 Tm (A student who recognizes an uncertainty and designs a valid test may demonstrate more scientific) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 380.06 Tm (judgment than one who submits a technically impressive but unexamined answer. AI may broaden) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 365.26 Tm (access to inquiry, but educational assessment should reward an increasing capacity to reason) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 350.46 Tm (independently and collaborate responsibly. This paper proposes applications, not evidence of) Tj ET
