0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 693.26 Tm (This case documents a transition from an architectural question to empirical computation, then to) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 678.46 Tm (explicit reflection on the investigator's ability and responsibility to judge the resulting work. The central) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 663.66 Tm (distinction is between the capability to initiate an investigation and the evidential basis for concluding) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 648.86 Tm (that its results are valid. AI can assist in closing the implementation gap, but may also expose a gap in) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 634.06 Tm (understanding. A versioned, human-directed workflow provides a means of organizing the response:) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 619.26 Tm (retain negative evidence, document changes, separate exploration from confirmation, seek qualified) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 604.46 Tm (help, and calibrate claims.) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 581.66 Tm (Three companion publications serve distinct purposes: a theoretical and computational architectural) Tj ET
0.098 0.204 0.220 rg BT /F1 10.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 566.86 Tm (framework, an empirical molecular reanalysis, and the present methodological case study. Their claims) Tj ET
